  "description": "Optional decision layer: hand small closed judgments (is this page relevant, does this source update or duplicate that page, do these two sections conflict) to a System One decision model (TypeSafe Jev) instead of reading pages to decide. Off by default. Use when the user says \"/wiki-decisions\", \"enable the decision layer\", \"use Jev\", \"gate my search results\", \"triage this ingest\", \"screen for contradictions\", or asks how the decision layer works or what it sends. Not a writer: it never answers questions, writes, merges or deletes pages. For the answering itself use wiki-query, wiki-ingest, wiki-dedup or wiki-lint.",
